"Requires that a Proof Key for Code Exchange (PKCE) is used.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_OIDC__TENANT__AUTHENTICATION_PKCE_REQUIRED+++[]\n"
